{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSBccZyi6SfGTL3qwNGK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Причины, которые видно по коду и логам:\n\n1. **Кнопка** — `<a href>` делает GET-навигацию, а она не несёт `Authorization`. Бэкенд отвечает 401 (лог, пункт 1).\n2. **400 на authorize** — `SCOPES` содержит `CALENDAR:READ` и `CALENDAR:WRITE` одновременно. Это совпадает с датой 2026-10-02, когда появился календарь (тикет #219). Рабочее подключение от 09-19 такого scope не запрашивало.\n3. **«Expired» через час** — код подставляет `DEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL = 3600`, когда провайдер не присылает `expires_in`. Токен при этом бессрочный, поэтому через час его помечают истёкшим.\n\nПравлю сервер."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7900,"cache_read_input_tokens":32631,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7900},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a7877f0-14a6-428e-9156-c370b39b9792","uuid":"d1c4d71f-3422-4751-a3d4-3aca74061222","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:23:58.171Z","request_id":"req_011CgSBccJ7HJsbifbZ5KN4Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgSBccZyi6SfGTL3qwNGK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q72Qp82RF5q6CkY2FqMcgX","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/private/tmp/h-j23kGR/server.py","old_string":"TOKEN_URL = config.INTERVALS_BASE + \"/api/oauth/token\"\nAUTHORIZE_URL = config.INTERVALS_BASE + \"/oauth/authorize\"\nDEFAULT_TOKEN_TTL = 3600   # seconds; used when the provider does not say how long a token lives\n\n# --- in-memory store -------------------------------------------------------\nUSERS = {\n    \"tok-okafor\": {\"id\": \"u_okafor\", \"name\": \"C. Okafor\"},\n    \"tok-rivera\": {\"id\": \"u_rivera\", \"name\": \"T. Rivera\"},\n}\n# user_id -> {athlete_id, athlete_name, access_token, refresh_token, scope, expires_at, status}","new_string":"TOKEN_URL = config.INTERVALS_BASE + \"/api/oauth/token\"\nAUTHORIZE_URL = config.INTERVALS_BASE + \"/oauth/authorize\"\n\n# --- in-memory store -------------------------------------------------------\nUSERS = {\n    \"tok-okafor\": {\"id\": \"u_okafor\", \"name\": \"C. Okafor\"},\n    \"tok-rivera\": {\"id\": \"u_rivera\", \"name\": \"T. Rivera\"},\n}\n# user_id -> {athlete_id, athlete_name, access_token, scope, status}\n# Intervals.icu tokens have no refresh_token and no expires_in: they live until\n# the athlete revokes the app, so we only learn they are dead from a 401."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7900,"cache_read_input_tokens":32631,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7900},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a7877f0-14a6-428e-9156-c370b39b9792","uuid":"0130a523-474d-49be-8aeb-